        <detaileddescription>
<para>Engine that runs this model, cached from the catalog when it was registered.</para>
<para>Cached rather than read live because the session&apos;s engine set is built from this manifest at CreateSession, before any ListModels round trip could answer — an editor that could only build a session while connected would be worse than none. Defaults to LlamaCpp, not Mock: Mock is the enum&apos;s zero value and a production server refuses it. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
